  },
  {
    "id": "bday_02",
    "quote": "今天是你的生日，公司決定送你一份大禮：准許你今天準時下班（如果事做完的話）。",
    "subtext": "壽星在職場上並沒有免死金牌",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "workday_birthday",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_03",
    "quote": "小時候許願希望快點長大，現在許願希望時間倒流回不用繳稅的年紀。",
    "subtext": "當年吹蠟燭的時候真的太衝動了",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_04",
    "quote": "生日願望不用許三個，三個都許『中威力彩頭獎』比較實在。",
    "subtext": "唯一能治癒老化的只有暴富",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_05",
    "quote": "恭喜你離法定退休年齡又邁進了一整年，雖然勞保到時候還在不在不好說。",
    "subtext": "再撐幾十年就可以領養老金囉",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "workday_birthday",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_06",
    "quote": "生日還要來上班的人，上輩子一定是折翼的打工天使。",
    "subtext": "今天誰敢改你的檔案，誰就折壽三年",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "workday_birthday",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_07",
    "quote": "到了這個年紀，生日禮物不想要鮮花跟卡片，只想要健檢報告全部沒有紅字。",
    "subtext": "膽固醇與體脂肪請勿跟著年紀一起成長",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "milestone",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_08",
    "quote": "祝你生日快樂！願你的髮際線永遠停留在二十歲，存款數字衝向八十歲。",
    "subtext": "最誠摯且實用的社畜祝福",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_09",
    "quote": "以前過生日是收禮物，現在過生日是收信用卡帳單跟銀行壽星推銷簡訊。",
    "subtext": "全世界最記得你生日的永遠是保險業務員",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_10",
    "quote": "今天你是壽星你最大——我是說在走出公司大門之後。",
    "subtext": "打卡前還是要先把手上的報表交出來",
    "character": "cat",
    "category": "workday_birthday",
    "sceneId": "cat_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/cat_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/cat_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_11",
    "quote": "生日這天就別減肥了，畢竟你已經辛苦在地球上又多活了三百六十五天。",
    "subtext": "今天的蛋糕熱量由宇宙自動吸收，零卡路里",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_12",
    "quote": "今天你是壽星，法律規定你可以心安理得地當一塊什麼都不做的生日蛋糕。",
    "subtext": "躺平慶生法，省錢又養生",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_13",
    "quote": "多長一歲沒什麼好焦慮的，水豚活得再久，每天也只是泡澡跟發呆而已。",
    "subtext": "把年紀當成裝飾品，心態永遠三歲半",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_14",
    "quote": "祝你生日快樂！願你未來的每一天，都能睡到自然醒，數錢數到手抽筋。",
    "subtext": "雖然很俗氣，但這是最完美的祝福",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_15",
    "quote": "吹蠟燭太費肺活量了，今年我們直接用意念把蠟燭熄滅，然後開始吃蛋糕。",
    "subtext": "能省一分力氣，絕不多浪費一口氣",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_16",
    "quote": "三十歲不可怕，可怕的是三十歲了還得設早上七點的鬧鐘起床。",
    "subtext": "願你早日實現『鬧鐘自由』",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "milestone",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_17",
    "quote": "生日大餐吃什麼不重要，重要的是吃完之後能立刻躺回床上滑手機。",
    "subtext": "壽星專屬行程：吃飽睡，睡飽吃",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_18",
    "quote": "今年你沒有變老，你只是變得更資深、更適合在沙發上生根發芽了。",
    "subtext": "陳年老廢物比新鮮小廢物更有韻味",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "milestone",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_19",
    "quote": "祝你生日快樂！今天所有的家事、公事、煩心事，一律順延到明年再處理。",
    "subtext": "今日壽星享有二十四小時豁免權",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_20",
    "quote": "別管幾歲了，只要還搶得到雞排跟珍奶，你永遠都是快樂的少年。",
    "subtext": "全糖珍奶是致敬青春最好的香檳",
    "character": "capybara",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "capy_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/capy_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/capybara_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_21",
    "quote": "社恐人最恐怖的生日酷刑，就是全餐廳的店員突然圍過來拍手幫你唱生日快樂歌。",
    "subtext": "當下只想連人帶椅直接穿透地板消失",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "introvert_birthday",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_22",
    "quote": "把社群軟體的生日通知關掉，是我給自己最安靜、最頂級的生日禮物。",
    "subtext": "不用一則一則回『謝謝！』真的太爽了",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "introvert_birthday",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_23",
    "quote": "生日願望：希望今年沒有人約我出去慶生，讓我一個人在家安靜追劇吃炸雞。",
    "subtext": "獨處才是社恐壽星的極樂世界",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "introvert_birthday",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_24",
    "quote": "今天是你的破蛋日，雖然有時候覺得當初真不該破那個蛋出來當社畜。",
    "subtext": "既來之，則躺之，生日快樂！",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_25",
    "quote": "第三個不能說出來的生日願望，我幫你猜到了：希望討厭的人全部原地消失。",
    "subtext": "噓，說出來就不靈了",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_26",
    "quote": "又在人間成功存活了一整年，你的生命力比辦公室的蟑螂還要頑強！",
    "subtext": "給自己頒發一張『年度最佳生存獎』",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_27",
    "quote": "生日快樂！今天你的社交電量獲得壽星無限加成——開玩笑的，還是只有 5%。",
    "subtext": "切完蛋糕就可以準備戴耳機隱身了",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "introvert_birthday",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_28",
    "quote": "如果有人問你今年幾歲，請微笑回答：『商業機密，無可奉告。』",
    "subtext": "年齡就像體重跟存款，屬於國家級機密",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "milestone",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_29",
    "quote": "生日這天請把手機設為勿擾模式，任何談論工作的人都將遭到壽星的怨念詛咒。",
    "subtext": "結界已開啟，閒雜人等退散",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "workday_birthday",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
    "spriteSheet": "/assets/sheets/ghost_sheet.jpg",
    "spritePosition": "100% 100%"
  },
  {
    "id": "bday_30",
    "quote": "祝你生日快樂！就算全世界都忘記今天，我這隻小幽靈也會在日曆裡陪你乾杯。",
    "subtext": "敬又老了一歲卻依然可愛的你",
    "character": "ghost",
    "category": "general",
    "sceneId": "ghost_birthday",
    "assetPath": "/assets/scenes/ghost_birthday.webp",
